sequenceDiagram
  participant test as Validation client
  participant source as Source PostgreSQL
  participant store as WAL-G object storage
  participant recover as Recovery workflow
  test->>source: Commit A
  source->>store: Base backup and archived WAL
  test->>source: Record UTC target T
  test->>source: Commit B after T
  source->>store: Archive post-target WAL
  test->>recover: Explicit opt-in restore to T
  recover->>store: Fetch selected base backup and WAL
  recover->>source: Recover until T and promote
  test->>source: Assert A present and B absent
  test->>source: Commit C and compare replica data
